          <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
``ps-t0`` diffuse, ``ps-t1`` light map, under ``NNFix``: a source slot&apos;s normal map is
dropped and the rest shifted down. Every target before Citlali -- Yelan, Bennett, Ganyu
</verbatim> </para>
